<h1>Measure Context Menus</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>Measure Context menus are available for labels and dimensions from different locations:</p>
<p><a href="#Tree_labels">Tree Context Menu for Labels</a></p>
<p><a href="#Viewport_Labels">Viewport Context Menu for Labels</a></p>
<p><a href="#Viewport_Dimensions">Viewport Context Menu for Dimensions</a></p>
<p><a href="#Viewport_GapFlush">Viewport Context Menu for Gap and Flush</a></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Tree_labels"></a>Tree context Menu for Labels</p>
<p><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Put Label</b></span> and <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Remove Label</b></span> commands are available for every datum entity and for the Datuming group from the Entities tree.</p>
